    "media:imagetext": "Menu\nBeverages\nBourbon • Tennessee Whiskey • Scotch\nCanadian • Blended Whiskey\nMartini\nVodka Martini\nBloody Mary • Daiquiri • Manhattan\nWhiskey Sour • Gin • Sherry\nSoda • Ginger Ale • Tonic • Water\nAmericana Salad\nCrisp Garden Greens Garnished with Fruits and\nVegetables from the Fertile Valleys of America\nAngus Tenderloin Steak\nFrom Midwest Feed Lots, the Best of American Beef\nChicken Americana\nRegional Favorites — Selected by Our Chef\nThe cost is one dollar per drink. Service is\nlimited to two drinks per passenger. If you\ndesire two drinks, please order both at this time.\nCrabmeat Juneau\nSucculent Pieces of Alaskan Crabmeat\nIn a Delicately Flavored Wine Sauce\nGarden Fresh Vegetables\nDinner Roll and Butter\nChampagne, Beer, Red and\nWhite\nWine is available\nfor purchase on this fight.\nWhy not enjoy some with\nvour meal!\nDessert\nFavorites from the Midwest and Western Regions\nChampagne and Wine... $1.00 per bottle\nBeer.\n$1.00 for two cans\nWe are so glad you could join us today!\nT-331\nPRINTED IN U.S.A.",
